headwater/taxonomy 0.1.0

declarations
  taxonomy (required) scalar:string
  version (required) scalar:string
  extends one of [scalar:string | scalar:null]
  vocabularies map of seq of one of [scalar:string | members
          value (required) scalar:string
          role enum[initial live terminal-retained]]
  purposes map of members
      intent (required) scalar:string
      answers seq of scalar:string
  facets map of members
      role enum[state state_entered created freshness scent name]
      values seq reference:allowed of one of [scalar:string | members
            value (required) scalar:string
            role enum[initial live terminal-retained]]
      type enum[string integer boolean date duration]
      required scalar:boolean
      severity enum[error warn info]
      stale_after_days scalar:integer
      volatility enum[stable mutable]
      guidance map of scalar:string
  regimes members
    voice map of members
        forbid seq of scalar:string
    lifecycle map of members
        initial (required) scalar:string
        transitions (required) map of seq of scalar:string
        terminal seq of scalar:string
        retain_terminal scalar:boolean
    language map of members
        tag (required) scalar:string
        controlled scalar:string
        profile scalar:string
        source_form enum[unconstrained one_line_per_block]
        retired_terms seq of members
            term (required) scalar:string
            reason (required) scalar:string
            replacement scalar:string
  relations map of members
      family (required) enum[succession derivation governance evidence composition association]
      from (required) seq of scalar:string
      to (required) seq of scalar:string
      inverse scalar:string
      reciprocal enum[required symmetric optional]
      nuclearity enum[multinuclear nucleus-satellite]
      nucleus enum[from to]
      inherits seq of scalar:string
      cardinality enum[one many]
      created_by (required) enum[author scaffold generator hook agent import]
      attributes map of members
          type enum[string integer boolean date duration]
          values seq of scalar:string
          owner (required) enum[source target edge]
      on_target members
        set_state (required) scalar:string
      invalid_when members
        both map of scalar:string
  anchors map of members
      resolver (required) scalar:string
  shelves map of members
      path (required) scalar:string
      homogeneous (required) scalar:boolean
      kind scalar:string
      discriminator scalar:string
      kinds seq of scalar:string
      group_by scalar:string
      layout scalar:string
  kinds map of members
      abstract scalar:boolean
      is_a scalar:string
      purpose scalar:string
      identifier members
        scheme (required) scalar:string
      voice scalar:string
      lifecycle scalar:string
      language scalar:string
      facets members
        require seq of scalar:string
        optional seq of scalar:string
        forbid seq of scalar:string
      sections members
        require seq of scalar:string
        optional seq of scalar:string
      relations members
        expect seq of members
            id (required) scalar:string
            relation (required) scalar:string
            to_kind (required) scalar:string
            when map of scalar:string
            within (required) scalar:duration
            since (required) enum[created state_entered]
            severity enum[error warn info]
            rationale (required) scalar:string
  identifier_schemes map of members
      pattern (required) scalar:string
      namespace (required) scalar:string
      allocation (required) scalar:string
  core members
    requires (required) seq of one of [members
          facet_role (required) enum[state state_entered created freshness scent name] | members
          purpose (required) scalar:string | members
          relation_family (required) enum[succession derivation governance evidence composition association]
          lifecycle_sensitive scalar:boolean | members
          identifier_scheme (required) scalar:string]
  mappings seq of members
      to (required) scalar:string
      kinds map of members
          relation (required) enum[exactMatch closeMatch broadMatch narrowMatch relatedMatch]
          target (required) scalar:string
      facet_values map addressable:false of members
          relation (required) enum[exactMatch closeMatch broadMatch narrowMatch relatedMatch]
          target (required) scalar:string
  projections seq of members
      kind (required) enum[shelf_index shelf_sections relation_view agent_rules site_nav graph_export template transcription]
      for seq of scalar:string
      output (required) scalar:string
      profile scalar:string
      format scalar:string
      filter members
        include map of seq of scalar:string
        exclude map of seq of scalar:string
      tombstone enum[counted sealed]
      from members
        anchor (required) scalar:string
      identity members
        id (required) scalar:string
        kind (required) scalar:string
  obligations map of members
      statement (required) scalar:string
      rationale (required) scalar:string
      class (required) enum[cohesion coherence]
      prevents (required) scalar:string
      severity (required) enum[high medium low]
      disposition one of [members
          gap (required) members
            owner (required) scalar:string
            target scalar:string | members
          unverifiable (required) members
            reasoning (required) scalar:string]
  controls map of members
      mechanism (required) scalar:string
      discharges (required) seq of scalar:string
      trigger (required) scalar:string
      posture (required) enum[advisory blocking]
      acts (required) enum[preventive detective corrective adaptive]
      handoff scalar:string
      promotion one of [members
          criteria (required) members
            window (required) scalar:string
            threshold (required) scalar:string
            sample (required) scalar:string | members
          final_posture (required) members
            reasoning (required) scalar:string | members
          permanently_advisory (required) members
            reasoning (required) scalar:string | members
          produces_facts (required) members
            reasoning (required) scalar:string]

operations
  taxonomy scalar:string
  bundle scalar:string
  extends scalar:string
  requires seq of scalar:string
  add map addressable:false of free (the shape at the addressed node decides this)
  override map addressable:false of free (the shape at the addressed node decides this)
  add_to map addressable:false of free (the shape at the addressed node decides this)
  remove_from map addressable:false of free (the shape at the addressed node decides this)
  remove seq of scalar:string

unconstrained
  add: the shape at the addressed node decides this
  add_to: the shape at the addressed node decides this
  override: the shape at the addressed node decides this
  remove_from: the shape at the addressed node decides this

not run without a resolved taxonomy
  referential integrity: a reference resolves over the merged tree, so a name that an overlay supplies is not there yet
  anchor integrity: a resolver namespace collides across the base and every bundle, and one source holds only its own
  identifier integrity: two schemes collide across sources, and this repository's overlay mints four against a base that has one
  coverage: a shelf reaches a kind that a bundle may declare
  kind inheritance: `is_a` names a kind that the base declares and the bundle extends
  purpose completeness: a purpose is declared in one source and served by a kind in another
  determinism: two shelf patterns collide across sources
  role uniqueness: two facets claim one role across sources
  lifecycle soundness: an overlay may override the state vocabulary that the machine runs over
  relation coherence: `inherits` names facets that exist on both ends, and an end may be a kind from another source
  expectation well-formedness: an expectation names a relation and kinds that another source may declare
  core satisfiability: the core is checked on the result, and never on an operation
  facet canons: relevance asks whether any check reads the facet, over the resolved taxonomy
  kind rigidity: a kind name collides with a lifecycle-state value, and an overlay may replace the vocabulary
  edge provenance: `created_by` is required here, and whether the resolved relation set is author-free is the audit's
  overlay confluence: an overlay set is more than one source by definition
  mapping integrity: a mapping names kinds in two taxonomies, and neither is resolved here
